preamble
name "Immediate client receive half-close"
description "Client disables RX immediately; server must still receive all 20KiB"
timeout 10s
begin using tcp
server at local
client at local
server listen "127.0.0.1:39193"
client connect "127.0.0.1:39193"
client half-close-read
server drain 20KiB stamp-every 1KiB
client transmit 20KiB stamp-every 1KiB chunk 257B
client await-tx
client half-close-write
server await-rx
server receive-eot
server close
client close
end
outcome pass
when server.rx.bytes == 20KiB
and server.rx.integrity == valid
describe "The server received the entire 20KiB stream without corruption."
outcome fail "The proxy did not deliver the entire stream after the client called SHUT_RD."
outcome timeout "The proxy blocked the flow or failed to propagate FIN."
end
